anadian over the next 100 metres."] "\n\n" [:p {} "At half way Dolan and Nemesnik were absolutely level and the lead swapped back and forth for the next three lengths of the pool. Over the last 50 metres the two men battled furiously and Dolan just had enough left for victory, as Myden held on for third place. Both Dolan, Nemesnik and fifth place finisher " [:a {:href "/athletes/49518"} "Marcel Wouda"] " were alumni of the University of Michigan."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "B Final"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/51320"} "Tom Dolan"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "4:17.66 (2 h4)"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "4:14.90 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/51504"} "Eric Namesnik"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "4:16.21 (1 h2)"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "4:15.25 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/45997"} "Curtis Myden"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/CAN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/CAN.png"}] "CAN"]] [:td {} "4:18.43 (4 h4)"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "4:16.28 (3)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/45195"} "Matt Dunn"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/AUS"} [:img {:style "padding-rig